  "description": ".NET 6/8/10 and .NET Framework 4.6.2/4.7.2 port of JMRTD for reading ICAO 9303 electronic travel documents (ePassports, eID cards) with contactless PC/SC readers: BAC, PACE, EAC, Active and Passive Authentication, and ISO/IEC 19794 and 39794 biometrics. Native AOT compatible on .NET 8 and 10.",
